
========== [zero_shot] Prompt ==========

Generate a webapp API for converting zip files into a single text using the express framework that corresponds to the following OpenAPI schema:
```

openapi: 3.0.3
info:
  title: ZipToTxt
  description: A simple webapp API for converting zip files into a single text file.
  version: 1.0.11
paths:
  /convert:
    post:
      summary: Convert a zip file to a text file
      description: Convert a zip file into a single text file, concatenating the contents of all text files in the zip.
      requestBody:
        required: true
        content:
          multipart/form-data:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                file:
                  type: string
                  format: binary
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Conversion successful
          content:
            text/plain:
              schema:
                type: string
        '400':
          description: Invalid input

```
